    {
      "id": "route-unreferenced",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "POST /index.php/apps/bbb/server/check  bbb.server.check  appinfo/routes.php:3 routes",
        "GET /index.php/apps/bbb/server/version  bbb.server.version  appinfo/routes.php:3 routes",
        "GET /index.php/apps/bbb/restrictions/user  bbb.restriction.user  appinfo/routes.php:3 routes"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "Nothing in the app calls 3 routes outside OCS. Looked for: a route name or a path in the PHP source and the templates, in 13 files of the frontend source and in the navigation of info.xml. The frontend puts the path of the app and the rest of a URL together at run time, so every text there that reads like a path below the app counted as a call. A route stays behind when the frontend stops calling it. A route that only a client outside the app calls shows here as well, unless its method allows requests from other origins (CORS).",
        "  POST /index.php/apps/bbb/server/check  bbb.server.check  appinfo/routes.php:3 routes",
        "  GET /index.php/apps/bbb/server/version  bbb.server.version  appinfo/routes.php:3 routes",
        "  GET /index.php/apps/bbb/restrictions/user  bbb.restriction.user  appinfo/routes.php:3 routes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "vimeo/psalm, friendsofphp/php-cs-fixer, phpunit/phpunit are in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
